# African Dancing with Rhythm Culture

Don't forget that we have a regular [African dance class](/drum-dance-class-sunshine-coast/african-dance-classes/) every Tuesday night led by the beautiful Pascale Richy. These classes are for FUN! and for all fitness levels. All classes have LIVE African drumming and no dance experience is definitely ok!  It is a great class and we welcome everyone in the community. Join us for a night of African rhythm and movement at 6.30pm every week. Tuesday nights 6.30pm @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall $15 Join our Facebook community for the classes and [watch our video](https://www.facebook.com/groups/1735722343328787/) for week 3 here.
